ta-start=\"600\" data-end=\"633\">DDR5 RAM up to 7000+ MHz (OC)</strong>, ideal for power users, gamers, and content creators.</p>\n<p data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"990\">Equipped with next-gen <strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"724\">PCIe 5.0</strong>, <strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"747\">4× M.2 Gen4 slots</strong>, <strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"766\">6× SATA ports</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"790\">Intel Wi-Fi 6E</strong> with Bluetooth, this board ensures ultra-fast speed, low latency, and excellent connectivity. The <strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"901\">2.5G LAN</strong> and <strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"932\">USB 3.2 Gen 2x2 Type-C</strong> ports offer fast wired networking and peripheral support.</p>\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1235\">With premium components, extended heatsinks, and <strong data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1064\">14+1+1 power phases</strong>, the Z790-P ensures system stability and efficiency under load. It’s an ideal choice for professional builds, high-performance setups, and future-ready PC configurations.</p><p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1235\"><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1266\"><strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1266\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1674\"><li data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1331\">\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1331\">Supports <strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1320\">Intel 12th/13th/14th Gen Processors</strong> (LGA 1700)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1383\"><strong data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1351\">DDR5 Memory</strong> up to 7000+ MHz (OC), max 128GB</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1434\">\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1434\"><strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1404\">PCIe 5.0 x16</strong> + PCIe 4.0 and PCIe 3.0 slots</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1485\">\n<p data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1485\"><strong data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1457\">4× M.2 Gen4 x4</strong> slots + 6× SATA 6Gb/s ports</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1544\">\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1544\">Built-in <strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1511\">Wi-Fi 6E</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1530\">Bluetooth 5.3</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1544\">2.5G LAN</strong></p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1608\">\n<p data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1608\">Rear I/O: HDMI 2.1, DisplayPort 1.4, USB 3.2 Gen 2x2 Type-C</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1674\"><p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1674\">ATX Form Factor with robust thermal solution and power design</p></li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"ASUS PRIME B760M-K D4 12th/13th/14th GEN ATX MOTHERBOARD","href":"/asus-prime-b760m-k-d4-12th13th14th-gen-atx-motherboard","now":"14,100৳","old":"15,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ASUS PRIME Z790-P WIFI-CSM 12th/13th/14th GEN ATX MOTHERBOARD","href":"/asus-prime-z790-p-wifi-csm-12th13th14th-gen-atx-motherboard","now":"36,500৳","old":"38,300৳","single":""},{"name":"ASUS PRIME B760M-AYW WIFI 12th/13th/14th GEN ATX MOTHERBOARD","href":"/asus-prime-b760m-ayw-wifi-12th13th14th-gen-atx-motherboard","now":"19,000৳","old":"21,450৳","single":""},{"name":"MSI PRO Z790-A WIFI DDR5 Intel 12/13/14th Gen ATX Motherboard","href":"/msi-pro-z790-a-wifi-ddr5-intel-121314th-gen-atx-motherboard","now":"33,500৳","old":"34,000৳","single":""},{"name":"MAXSUN MS-Terminator B760M GKD5 ICE DDR5 LGA1700 Motherboard","href":"/maxsun-ms-terminator-b760m-gkd5-ice-ddr5-lga1700-motherboard","now":"","old":"","single":"17,500৳"},{"name":"Maxsun Challenger B760M-N D5 12th/13th Gen Motherboard","href":"/maxsun-challenger-b760m-n-d5-12th13th-gen-motherboard","now":"","old":"","single":"12,900৳"},{"name":"MAXUN MS-Challenger Z890M WIFI 